"view.ephemeris.help"              = "In the left part of the screen you enter a month and a year.\n\nYou can specify whether you want geocentric or heliocentric positions, and whether you want to use the sidereal or tropical zodiac. You can also choose from several coordinates and speeds.\n\nOf the planets that Enigma shows in the ephemeris, the planets you have specified in the configuration are already selected. You can adjust this selection.\n\nWith every change, the program automatically updates the results.\n\nIn the table you can see the positions, depending on the choices you have made. Via the 'Graph' tab you get a chart with the positions.\n\nThe table can be exported to PDF and the chart to PNG or PDF.";
